1811
01:08:22,567 --> 01:08:23,967
Boy I'm so exciting.

1812
01:08:23,967 --> 01:08:26,070
Having a writer's
workshop was a great idea.

1813
01:08:26,070 --> 01:08:27,805
I may even give up
writing spec scripts

1814
01:08:27,805 --> 01:08:30,007
