supportive, Tom.

1819
01:08:36,313 --> 01:08:37,782
- Yeah, well Whatever,

1820
01:08:37,782 --> 01:08:39,082
Joel, what made you decide
to have this dumb old

1821
01:08:39,082 --> 01:08:40,583
