1827
01:08:49,793 --> 01:08:51,028
Let's hear your
stories you guys.

1828
01:08:51,028 --> 01:08:52,930
- Okay, me first,
me first, me first.

1829
01:08:52,930 --> 01:08:54,165
(clears throat)

1830
01:08:54,165 --> 01:08:56,133
The vast emptiness of
space lay before me,

1831
01:08:56,133 --> 01:08:59,002
the stars in the galaxies
were apart from me,

1832
01:08:59,002 --> 01:09:01,105
yet seemed inside me also.

1833
01:09:01,105 --> 01:09:02,740
All of my deepest yearnings,

1834
01:09:02,740 --> 01:09:05,208
my most profound,
inner-most thoughts,

1835
01:09:05,208 --> 01:09:07,377
my striving, aching soul
that longed to love,

1836
01:09:07,377 --> 01:09:08,878
and be loved.

1837
01:09:08,878 --> 01:09:11,282
All of these things were
reflected in the twinkling

1838
01:09:11,282 --> 01:09:13,883
