- Uh, Crow, Crow, listen
that's all very well and good,

1841
01:09:17,522 --> 01:09:18,922
but if Merit Stone were here--

1842
01:09:18,922 --> 01:09:20,057
- He's not Merit Stone!

1843
01:09:20,057 --> 01:09:21,825
- If Merit Stone were here,

1844
01:09:21,825 --> 01:09:24,595
he would wonder why
there's no scene where

1845
