1918
01:12:00,917 --> 01:12:02,085
- [Joel] Hey, don't
take my last cigarette.

1919
01:12:02,085 --> 01:12:03,353
- Johnny?

1920
01:12:03,353 --> 01:12:04,688
- Here.

1921
01:12:04,688 --> 01:12:06,590
- Where'd you get
all that money?

1922
01:12:06,590 --> 01:12:07,992
- Stage money.

1923
01:12:07,992 --> 01:12:09,727
- [Servo] You're
in Guys and Dolls?

1924
01:12:13,997 --> 01:12:16,367
- [Crow] Phil never carries
stage money at home.

1925
01:12:18,335 --> 01:12:20,803
- [Joel] It's gonna take me
a few minutes to rationalize

1926
01:12:20,803 --> 01:12:21,638
this one.

1927
01:12:26,143 --> 01:12:28,578
