to Newark in the morning.

1931
01:12:36,053 --> 01:12:37,287
- A sound idea.

1932
01:12:37,287 --> 01:12:38,655
- [Joel] Father
Dowling Mysteries.

1933
01:12:38,655 --> 01:12:40,190
- Uh, one more thing.

1934
01:12:40,190 --> 01:12:41,425
- [Crow] You know I've
always wanted to be a priest,

1935
01:12:41,425 --> 01:12:42,860
I've forgiven a lot of
people in the years.

1936
01:12:42,860 --> 01:12:44,895
- One of the
passengers is missing.

1937
01:12:46,130 --> 01:12:47,063
- Indeed, who?

1938
01:12:47,063 --> 01:12:49,198
- That writer in compartment D.

1939
01:12:49,198 --> 01:12:51,302
The fellow I gave
all my stories to.

1940
