- A very good reason.

1944
01:12:58,075 --> 01:12:59,410
- Which was?

1945
01:12:59,410 --> 01:13:00,243
- His typewriter.

1946
01:13:01,945 --> 01:13:03,380
- [Servo] Hey, Edie Sedgwick.

1947
01:13:07,583 --> 01:13:10,420
- [Crow] And then when I
was 19 my skin cleared up,

1948
01:13:10,420 --> 01:13:11,355
