1949
01:13:11,355 --> 01:13:12,188
- Jeannie?

1950
01:13:13,123 --> 01:13:14,323
- Yes?

1951
01:13:14,323 --> 01:13:15,125
- [Joel] Is it almost
my turn to sleep?

1952
01:13:15,125 --> 01:13:15,792
- About that money.

1953
01:13:16,993 --> 01:13:18,895
- What about it, Johnny?

1954
01:13:18,895 --> 01:13:21,298
- [Servo] Well, I
got it selling grit.

1955
01:13:21,298 --> 01:13:22,498
- I've been lying to you.

1956
01:13:22,498 --> 01:13:24,702
- [Crow] I'm not really
a submarine captain.

1957
01:13:26,002 --> 01:13:27,103
- Where did you get it?

1958
01:13:27,103 --> 01:13:28,605
- [Joel] Caddying.

1959
01:13:28,605 --> 01:13:29,707
