1960
01:13:31,642 --> 01:13:33,210
- [Crow] The hydraulic wife.

1961
01:13:33,210 --> 01:13:34,878
- What are you saying?

1962
01:13:34,878 --> 01:13:35,878
- I helped steal it.

1963
01:13:36,880 --> 01:13:38,748
- [Servo] You got a job?

1964
01:13:38,748 --> 01:13:40,617
Oh, I love the Chicago robbery.

1965
01:13:42,118 --> 01:13:42,953
- Oh, Johnny, no.

1966
01:13:44,153 --> 01:13:46,423
