answer to everything.

1967
01:13:46,423 --> 01:13:47,858
I wanted to give you everything.

1968
01:13:47,858 --> 01:13:49,793
- [Crow] Well, not everything,
we don't have the closet

1969
01:13:49,793 --> 01:13:51,495
space but, you know what I mean.

1970
01:13:51,495 --> 01:13:52,362
- Oh, Johnny.

1971
01:13:52,362 --> 01:13:53,930
